<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6 animated fadeInLeft" id="left-column" style="z-index: 1;">


        <div class="ibox float-e-margins">
            <div class="ibox-title">
                <div class="pull-right">
                    
    <span class="badge badge-success">in 5 months</span>
  
                </div>
                <h4>Budapest Data+AI Forum 2027</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="ibox-content">


                <div class="row"> 
                        <div class="col-sm-6 m-b-md">
                            <div class="font-bold text-navy">
                                <i class="fal fa-calendar"></i>
                                event starts
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="no-margins">10 May 2027</h2>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6 m-b-md">
                            <div class="font-bold text-navy">
                                <i class="fal fa-calendar"></i>
                                event ends
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="no-margins">12 May 2027</h2>
                        </div>
                </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-sm-12 m-b-md">
                            <div class="font-bold text-navy">
                                <i class="fal fa-map-marker"></i>
                                location
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="no-margins">
                                <span class="block">Danubius Hotel Helia ****</span>
                                <span class="block">Budapest, Hungary</span>
                            </h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-sm-12 m-b-md">
                            <div class="font-bold text-navy">
                                <i class="fal fa-globe"></i>
                                website
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="no-margins ellipsis">
                                <a href="https://budapestdata.hu" class="navy-link" target="_blank">budapestdata.hu</a>
                            </h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-sm-12">
                        <hr class="m-t-none" />
                        <p>The Budapest Data+AI Forum is Hungary’s leading and longest-running independent conference on Data Management, Machine Learning and AI,  building on more than a decade of history as the former Budapest Data and ML Forum.&nbsp;<br><br>The next edition will run between <b>May 10-12, 2027</b></p><p><b>Key Dates</b></p><ul><li>May 10, Monday: In-person Conference Day 1</li><li>May 11, Tuesday: In-person Conference Day 2</li><li>May 12, Wednesday: Online Day</li></ul><p><b>Venue</b></p><p>Danubius Hotel Helia ****<br>Hungary, Budapest, Kárpát u. 62-64, 1133<br><a href="https://budapestdata.hu/en/info/venue/" target="_blank">https://budapestdata.hu/en/info/venue/</a><br><br><b>Website:</b>&nbsp;<a href="https://budapestdata.hu/en/" target="_blank">https://budapestdata.hu/en/</a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>


            </div>
        </div>


    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 animated fadeInRight" id="right-column">



        <div class="ibox float-e-margins">
            <div class="ibox-title">
                <div class="pull-right">
                        
    <span class="badge badge-default">finished 24 days ago</span>
 
                </div>
                <h5>Call for Speakers</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="ibox-content">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-sm-6 m-b-sm">
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-bold text-navy">Call opens at 12:00 AM</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="no-margins">04 Sep 2026</h2>
                        <small></small>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6 m-b-sm">
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-bold text-navy">Call closes at 11:59 PM</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="no-margins">01 Nov 2026</h2>

                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-sm-12 m-b-md">

                        <small class="text-muted">
                            Call closes in <strong>W. Europe Standard Time (UTC+01:00)</strong> timezone.
                        </small>
                        <div class="toLocalDateTime">
                            <small class="text-muted">
                                Closing time in your timezone (<span class="timezone"></span>) is <strong data-date="Sun, 01 Nov 2026 22:59:00 GMT|60"></strong>.
                            </small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <hr class="m-t-none" />
                            <p>Welcome to the <b>Budapest Data+AI 2027 CfS!</b></p><p>We invite you to join us as a speaker and contribute a technical talk, case study, or best-practice presentation aligned with the conference themes. You can find the full list of topics here:&nbsp;<a href="https://budapestdata.hu/en/program/" target="_blank">https://budapestdata.hu/en/program/</a></p><p>For everything you need to know about presentation requirements and speaker benefits please visit:&nbsp;<a href="https://budapestdata.hu/en/program/call-for-speakers/" target="_blank">https://budapestdata.hu/en/program/call-for-speakers/</a><a href="https://budapestdata.hu/en/program/call-for-speakers/" target="_blank"></a><br><br>By submitting, you agree:<br>- that we can share your speaker bio data publicly, as well as other profile information such social media or website links. We will not publish your e-mail, phone number, or other private information.<br>- that we can publish photographs of you and your sessions.<br>- that your session will be recorded.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                                                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <hr class="m-t-none" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                                                    <div class="col-sm-4 m-b-md">
                                <i class="fal fa-bed"></i>
                                <h3 class="no-margins font-normal">accommodation</h3>
                                <div class="font-bold text-navy">expenses covered</div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="col-sm-4 m-b-md">
                                <i class="fal fa-ticket"></i>
                                <h3 class="no-margins font-normal">event fee</h3>
                                <div class="font-bold text-navy">free for speakers</div>
                            </div>
                    </div>
                

            </div>

        </div>


    </div>
</div>




            </div>
        </div>

        

    </div>
</div>


    

    
